@startuml
actor Maintainer
participant "Dependency preflight" as Preflight
participant "Manifest + compiled lock" as Lock
participant "Retained archives" as Archives
participant "Reference/prefix" as Payload
participant "CMake envelope" as Build
Maintainer -> Preflight: verify-toolchain
Preflight -> Lock: validate file identities and policy metadata
Preflight -> Archives: verify hashes and Debian metadata
Preflight -> Payload: extract and compare complete locked payload
alt identity or payload rejected
  Preflight --> Maintainer: classified JSON failure (no executable probe)
else payload admitted
  Preflight -> Payload: probe admitted executables and metadata
  Preflight -> Build: configure/build policy probe with selected compiler
  Build -> Preflight: compiler and effective-policy evidence
  Preflight --> Maintainer: admitted or classified JSON failure
end
@enduml
